Figure 10 gives a heap based operational semantics for our Perceus
calculus. Here we generalize the store S from the FIP calculus (Figure
5) to contain a reference count \emph{n} ⩾1 for each binding. The heap
now contains reuse credits ⋄\emph{k}, a constructor binding \emph{x}
↦→\emph{nC x}, or a closure \emph{x} ↦→\emph{n𝜆zx. e}.

