lemma 2 (see below) to prove that for

with Γ1 and Γ2 swapped which implies pairwise disjointness. any \emph{x}
∈dom(S{[}Γ1{]}), we have \emph{x} ̸∈dom(S{[}Γ2{]}) and \emph{x}
