Δ\emph{,} Γ)

If Δ \textbar{} Γ ⊢\emph{e}, then fv(\emph{e}) ⊆Δ\emph{,} Γ.

\textbf{Proof}. By induction on the judgement Δ \textbar{} Γ
⊢\emph{e}.\\
